QuestGuidance.Register("en",421,{
[13441]="70008179\n1\tCollect furs from wolves or bears (total: 10)\tBears and wolves can be found on the northern hills of Annúndir, west of Ost Lagoros. Orthonn wishes to send warm furs to the refugees guarded by Amarion at Amon Raith.\n2\tBring the hides you gathered to Orthonn\tOrthonn awaits you at Ost Lagoros, south-east of Annúndir and across the river. You should bring the furs you gathered to Orthonn.\n",
[13442]="7002CA92\n1\tCollect wood (total: 7)\030Collect ore (total: 7)\tWood and ore can be found in the plains surrounding the abandoned farm. You should collect wood and ore for the farm's supply.\n2\tReturn to Gadda\tGadda can be found at the abandoned farm. You should bring the materials you gathered to Gadda for his supply.\n",
[13443]="700529E8\n1\tDefeat goblins inside Goblin-town (total: 15)\030Defeat goblins at the Goblin-gate (total: 10)\tYou should defeat goblins at the Goblin-gate and inside Goblin-town.\n2\tCompleted\tYou defeated many goblins within Goblin-town.\n",
[13444]="700304A7\n1\tDefeat Orcs at Wyrthing (total: 10)\030Collect Orc-weapons from fallen Orcs (total: 6)\tOrcs can be found north of Snowbourn. Gísling wants you to thin out the Orcs surrounding Snowbourn and recover their vile weapons so that no other Orc may wield them again.\n2\tTalk to Gísling\tGísling is in central Snowbourn. You should return to Gísling with news of your success.\n",
[13445]="700001A7\n1\tDefeat Uruks in Urugarth and Carn Dûm (total: 10)\030Defeat Orcs in Urugarth and Carn Dûm (total: 20)\tUrugarth and Carn Dûm lie to the west of Gath Forthnír. Donaith asked you to support the cause of his people and defeat the Orcs which gather in Urugarth or Carn Dûm.\n2\tTalk to Donaith\tDonaith can be found at Gath Forthnír. Return to Donaith in eastern Angmar and tell him of your deeds.\n",
[13446]="70050E1D\n1\tDefeat Taurogrim (total: 10)\tThe Taurogrim are a vicious tribe of Wood-trolls that have infested the woods of Thornholt. The fewer there are, the safer it will be for the dwarves to gather wood here.\n2\tCompleted\tThe Taurogrim are a vicious tribe of Wood-trolls that have infested the woods of Thornholt.\n",
[13447]="70067EE7\n1\tAssist Tankho with his needs\030Assist Beliash with his needs\030Assist Kharishah with his needs\030Assist Hûzo with his needs\030Assist Taphis with her needs\030Assist Ulanor with her needs\t\n2\tTalk to Nûrut in Rakhatâb\tYou addressed the concerns of the foremen in the fort and should return to Nûrut where you found him in Rakhatâb.\n",
[13448]="70026508\n1\tSpice the stew and defeat the goblin-cook\tThe dreadful goblin-cook is constantly at work in his kitchens in the caves of western Nan Curunir. Ondor suggests that if you can slip the goblin-cook's deadly spice into his stew-pot, it may weaken him enough that you can readily defeat him.\n2\tTalk to Ondor in Nan Curunir\tOndor is encamped near the caves of western Nan Curunir. You should let Ondor know that the goblin-cook has cooked his last stew.\n",
[13449]="700095CB\n1\tBring the sharp-thistle plants to Thrasi\030Collect sharp-thistle plants (total: 6)\tThere are sharp-thistle plants around the wood north of Thrasi's lodge. Thrasi asked you to collect sharp-thistle plants to make a draught to cure the mother lynx's injuries.\n",
[13450]="7000005E\n1\tDeliver Thistlewool's letter to Anlaf the Forlorn\tAnlaf the Forlorn can be found at The Forsaken Inn, eastward along the Great East Road. Thomas Thistlewool has asked you to deliver a letter to Anlaf the Forlorn, the proprietor of The Forsaken Inn, promising payment for a debt incurred by a Man he hired to seek ancient relics for him.\n",
[13451]="7005A995\n1\tDestroy Orc weapons at Tholmuzog\tTholmuzog can be found in Máttugard. You should destroy Orc weapons at Tholmuzog.\n2\tDestroy Orc weapons barrels (total: 10)\030Destroy Orc weapons racks (total: 10)\tTholmuzog can be found in Máttugard. You should destroy Orc weapons at Tholmuzog.\n",
[13452]="7005A99A\n1\tDestroy Orc supplies and provisions at Tholmuzog\tTholmuzog can be found in Máttugard. You should destroy Orc supplies and provisions at Tholmuzog.\n2\tDestroy Orc supplies (total: 10)\030Destroy Orc provisions (total: 10)\tTholmuzog can be found in Máttugard. You should destroy Orc supplies and provisions at Tholmuzog.\n",
[13453]="7000BF82\n1\tDiscover if Jakka of the Gauredain carries an antidote\tThe Gauradan-camps lie to the south of Thorgest's dwelling. Afwald has asked you to try and find the chief spirit-caller of the Gauredain in the last desperate hope that he may hold the cure to the poison that is slowly killing Thorgest.\n2\tBring the Ice-fang antidote to Afwald\tAfwald is at Thorgest's dwelling, north of the Gauradan-camps. You should bring the Ice-fang antidote to Afwald before Thorgest succumbs to the poison.\n3\tApply the Ice-fang antidote to Thorgest\tThorgest is at his dwelling, with Afwald. Afwald has told you that Thorgest is fading quickly and that you must administer the antidote to the dying dwarf before it is too late.\n",
[13454]="7000C09E\n1\tTalk to Ransroth\tBy completing this quest, you will be considered an Acquaintance of Thorin's Hall.\n",
[13455]="7000C09F\n1\tTalk to Ransroth\tBy completing this quest, you will be considered a Friend of Thorin's Hall.\n",
[13456]="7000C0A0\n1\tTalk to Ransroth\tBy completing this quest, you will be considered an Ally of Thorin's Hall.\n",
[13457]="7000C0A1\n1\tTalk to Ransroth\tBy completing this quest, you will be considered Kindred to Thorin's Hall.\n",
[13458]="70024835\n1\tDeliver the albino skin to Afwald within the ruins of Hrimbarg in the Misty Mountains\030Collect albino skin (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to deliver albino skin from the worms found in the eastern reaches of the Misty Mountains to Afwald. Afwald can be found within the ruins at Hrimbarg, also found in the Misty Mountains.\n",
[13459]="70024427\n1\tDeliver the broken daggers to Dorri at Gondamon\030Collect broken daggers (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to acquire broken daggers. You are to deliver them to Dorri at the western gate of Gondamon to earn favour with Thorin's Hall.\n",
[13460]="70024749\n1\tDeliver the broken great swords to Avar at Gabilshathûr in Angmar\030Collect broken great swords (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to collect and deliver broken great swords from the Orcs surrounding Gabilshathûr to Avar at the dwarf-outpost.\n",
[13461]="7002480D\n1\tDeliver the broken great swords to Fotri at Zigilgund in Forochel\030Collect the broken great swords (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to collect and deliver broken great swords from the Dourhands and Gauredain surrounding Zigilgund in Forochel. The items are to be delivered to the dwarf-overseer Fotri encamped at the dwarf-home.\n",
[13462]="70024832\n1\tDeliver the broken great swords to Afwald within the ruins of Hrimbarg in the Misty Mountains\030Collect broken great swords (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to deliver broken great swords from the Gauredain and goblins found in the eastern reaches of the Misty Mountains to Afwald. Afwald can be found within the ruins at Hrimbarg, also found in the Misty Mountains.\n",
[13463]="7002482B\n1\tCollect broken halberds and drop them in a collection box (total: 10)\tCollection boxes for this task can be found at the camps within the Misty Mountains. You should bring the trophies you gathered to a collection box.\n",
[13464]="70024813\n1\tDeliver the broken longswords to Heithur Ironfist at Barachen's Camp in the Trollshaws\030Collect broken longswords (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to collect broken longswords from the Hill-men and trolls in the western stretches of the Trollshaws. You are to deliver the items to Heithur Ironfist, a dwarf taking refuge at Barachen's Camp, south of the road in the western Trollshaws.\n",
[13465]="7002442E\n1\tDeliver the broken sword sheaths to Dorri at Gondamon\030Collect broken sword sheaths (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to acquire broken sword sheaths. You are to deliver them to Dorri at the western gate of Gondamon to earn favour with Thorin's Hall.\n",
[13466]="7002453A\n1\tDeliver the broken wood spears to Birgir Listmaker at Othrikar\030Collect broken wood spears (total: 10)\tYou are on a task to deliver broken wood spears from the Dourhands in the North Downs to Birgir Listmaker at Othrikar. Othrikar is north of Esteldín in the North Downs.\n",
[13467]="70024755\n1\tDeliver the clean tails to Avar at Gabilshathûr in Angmar\030Collect clean tails (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to collect and deliver clean tails from the worms surrounding Gabilshathûr to Avar at the dwarf-outpost.\n",
[13468]="7002480C\n1\tDeliver the clean tails to Fotri at Zigilgund in Forochel\030Collect clean tails (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to collect and deliver clean tails from the worms surrounding Zigilgund in Forochel. The items are to be delivered to the dwarf-overseer Fotri encamped at the dwarf-home.\n",
[13469]="7002453B\n1\tDeliver the coarse furs to Birgir Listmaker at Othrikar\030Collect coarse furs (total: 10)\tYou are on a task to deliver coarse furs from the beasts in the North Downs to Birgir Listmaker at Othrikar. Othrikar is north of Esteldín in the North Downs.\n",
[13470]="7002453C\n1\tDeliver the coarse skins to Birgir Listmaker at Othrikar\030Collect coarse skins (total: 10)\tYou are on a task to deliver coarse skins from the beasts in the North Downs to Birgir Listmaker at Othrikar. Othrikar is north of Esteldín in the North Downs.\n",
[13471]="70024431\n1\tDeliver the dirty filth to Dorri at Gondamon\030Collect dirty filth (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to acquire dirty filth. You are to deliver them to Dorri at the western gate of Gondamon to earn favour with Thorin's Hall.\n",
[13472]="70024422\n1\tDeliver the dirty wings to Dorri at Gondamon\030Collect dirty wings (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to acquire dirty wings. You are to deliver them to Dorri at the western gate of Gondamon to earn favour with Thorin's Hall.\n",
})
